        "description": "Polls v1.x — flat option row, surfaced on the admin SPA edit page so\r\nmanagers can SEE the existing options without us having to expose the\r\nfull Polls API surface here. Read-only on this DTO: editing options on\r\na poll that already has votes would invalidate the vote-after-lock\r\nguarantee, so option edits stay out of the v1 admin update path.",
